<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1158763993"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:18.552"><div begin="14.798" end="43.304" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="14.798" end="21.450" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.798" end="16.676">想把你写</span><span begin="16.676" end="17.129">成</span><span begin="17.129" end="17.343">一</span><span begin="17.343" end="17.744">首</span><span begin="17.744" end="18.267">歌</span> <span begin="18.446" end="18.879">想</span><span begin="18.879" end="19.114">养</span><span begin="19.114" end="19.831">一</span><span begin="19.831" end="20.112">只</span><span begin="20.112" end="21.450">猫</span></p><p begin="21.926" end="28.493" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.926" end="23.815">想要回到</span><span begin="23.815" end="24.284">每</span><span begin="24.284" end="24.467">个</span><span begin="24.467" end="24.920">场</span><span begin="24.920" end="25.704">景</span> <span begin="25.704" end="26.070">拨</span><span begin="26.070" end="26.255">慢</span><span begin="26.255" end="26.705">每</span><span begin="26.705" end="27.422">只</span><span begin="27.422" end="28.493">表</span></p><p begin="28.519" end="35.645" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.519" end="29.173">我们在</span><span begin="29.173" end="29.637">小</span><span begin="29.637" end="29.851">孩</span><span begin="29.851" end="30.568">和</span><span begin="30.568" end="30.786">大</span><span begin="30.786" end="31.422">人</span><span begin="31.422" end="31.671">的</span><span begin="31.671" end="32.089">转</span><span begin="32.089" end="32.647">角</span> <span begin="32.810" end="33.294">盖</span><span begin="33.294" end="33.680">一</span><span begin="33.680" end="33.930">座</span><span begin="33.930" end="34.380">城</span><span begin="34.380" end="35.645">堡</span></p><p begin="35.682" end="43.304" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.682" end="36.379">我们好</span><span begin="36.379" end="37.380">好</span> <span begin="37.486" end="38.184">好到疯</span><span begin="38.184" end