">好</span></p><p begin="1:04.408" end="1:10.586" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.408" end="1:05.095">一切好</span><span begin="1:05.095" end="1:05.977">好</span> <span begin="1:06.092" end="1:06.813">是否太</span><span begin="1:06.813" end="1:07.315">好</span> <span begin="1:07.506" end="1:07.739">没</span><span begin="1:07.739" end="1:08.589">有人知</span><span begin="1:08.589" end="1:10.586">道</span></p></div><div begin="1:10.760" end="1:26.673" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:10.760" end="1:15.225" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.760" end="1:14.048">你和我背着空空</span><span begin="1:14.048" end="1:14.266">的</span><span begin="1:14.266" end="1:14.649">书</span><span begin="1:14.649" end="1:15.225">包</span></p><p begin="1:15.343" end="1:19.037" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.343" end="1:15.788">逃出</span><span begin="1:15.788" end="1:17.592">名为日常</span><span begin="1:17.592" end="1:17.824">的</span><span begin="1:17.824" end="1:18.277">监</span><span begin="1:18.277" end="1:19.037">牢</span></p><p begin="1:19.123" end="1:22.689" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.123" end="1:19.427">忘</span><span begin="1:19.427" end="1:19.816">了</span><span begin="1:19.816" end="1:19.981">要</span><span begin="1:19.981" end="1:20.466">长</span><span begin="1:20.466" end="1:20.927">大</span> <span begin="1:20.960" end="1:21.186">忘</span><span begin="1:21.186" end="1:21.568">了</span><span begin="1:21.568" end="1:21.761">要</span><span begin="1:21.761" end="1:22.254">变</span><span begin="1:22.254" end="1:22.689">老</span></p><p begin="1:22.717" end="1:26.673" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.717" end="1:22.997">忘</span><span begin="1:22.997" end="1:23.872">了时</span><span begin="1:23.872" end="1:24.089">间</span><span begin="1:24.089" end="1:24.505">有</span><span begin="1:24.505" end="1:26.673">脚</span></p></div><div begin="1:33.650" end="2:00.699" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:33.650" end="1:40.490" itunes:key="L13" 